{"type":"message","id":"b9833985","parentId":"0d98195f","timestamp":"2026-05-26T09:22:25.136Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read_ts_AY89a1-Z61ZDAMjavXwHZnwcuimEkfbpOGsDHQkJEfFqU2r9QERWOjBTwkXHdsj0y3ac567uIx9w1AychfmktTX2alwg0kpmbRZVzOgi2Hu2C8Fp1k3Dj75RBA8ch9esXJ3rT4CeAMcF7GQEZTc2dNnlwWH9gSSv_Oj5qo0uq9R8sKtCVEY5Gn9zjpzFiYUR5-bbFWyThkxblrq-wpmRMRCbj7I81vDVpBfq7zfheHLB1OxOXxjqzgGTmQ5sXf0DwM__MkPp1biHV4oa1Y2E0DHuCyExEaop3Fpuas6hVwp9Rqp_EABGHqSxvKbdSsDAtXVnmOwAMVWXUF05kTLb87iM6U-Z-rTGdPevrG0Kr08H8HVaycOyR6Od6c3OEU6iTomzleCnPrxxvzKR4skA3ImnUA4RD3sEPovOonuxcvgpZwcL4ntbOlTdfobBMcJ4gApOs_sqWl8q2997WnCgZ_JcL97IXB266NSaHQhHOg-eupXR8CRBWtIA2GD-7aEyMhCkaos","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"story_id\": \"kelp-dao-rseth-recovery-complete-2026-05-26\",\n  \"topic_theme\": \"Kelp DAO Completes rsETH Recovery Following April Hack\",\n  \"primary_keyword\": \"Kelp DAO rsETH\",\n  \"primary_headline\": \"Kelp DAO Completes rsETH Recovery Plan With 116,000 Tokens Fully Restored\",\n  \"primary_asset\": \"Ethereum\",\n  \"chart_coin\": \"ethereum\",\n  \"sources_used\": [\n    \"CoinTelegraph\",\n    \"CryptoFox\"\n  ],\n  \"source_urls\": [\n    \"https://cointelegraph.com/news/kelpdao-says-rseth-restored-5-weeks-after-protocol-hack\",\n    \"https://cryptofox.news/news/kelp-dao-completes-rseth-recovery-plan-with-116000-tokens-restored\"\n  ],\n  \"combined_key_facts\": [\n    \"Kelp DAO completed the operational phase of its rsETH recovery plan on May 26, 2026, transferring the final batch of 20,373.72 rsETH to the rsETH OFT adapter.\",\n    \"A total of approximately 116,000 rsETH has been fully replenished over a 14-day recovery window in coordination with the Aave protocol.\",\n    \"The recovery follows a devastating exploit in April 2026 where the attacker put stolen rsETH up as collateral on Aave to borrow wrapped Ether, leaving $190 million in bad debt.\",\n    \"The hack and subsequent withdrawals caused Aave's Total Value Locked (TVL) to fall from $26.4 billion to under $14 billion, losing its spot as the largest DeFi protocol by TVL.\",\n    \"Kelp DAO confirmed that all core services, including rsETH minting, redemptions, and rewards operations, are now functioning normally across supported Layer 2 networks.\"\n  ],\n  \"aggregated_raw_content\": \"Kelp DAO has officially completed the operational phase of its rsETH recovery plan, marking a major milestone in restoring the liquid restaking token's cross-chain infrastructure. On May 26, 2026, the project confirmed that the final batch of 20,373.72 rsETH had been transferred to the rsETH OFT (Omnichain Fungible Token) adapter. This transaction concludes a intensive two-week recovery window during which Kelp and the Aave protocol worked in tandem to stabilize the ecosystem. In total, approximately 116,000 rsETH has been replenished to the adapter, addressing previous liquidity imbalances and ensuring the technical robustness of the LayerZero-based OFT standard.\\n\\nWith the completion of the recovery plan, Kelp DAO reported that all fundamental operations have returned to normalcy. Minting, redemptions, and rewards operations are now functioning without interruption.\\n\\nThe Kelp DAO exploit in April 2026 had caused a massive ripple effect throughout the crypto lending market, disrupting billions of dollars in liquidity and resurfacing deep concerns about DeFi interconnectivity. Aave was hit particularly hard when the attacker deposited a large portion of the stolen 116,500 rsETH as collateral to borrow wrapped Ether, leaving $190 million in bad debt and triggering a wave of withdrawals. This exploit contributed to Aave's TVL falling from $26.4 billion to below $14 billion, losing its long-held position as the largest DeFi protocol by TVL. \\n\\nFollowing the successful execution of this recovery plan, rsETH bridging between Ethereum mainnet and Layer 2 environments has reopened, stabilizing the liquid restaking (LRT) sector which has become a cornerstone of the modern DeFi landscape.\"\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779787345136}}
